<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Interface for reading the water-level float switch. </para>

<para>This module wraps the STM32 HAL GPIO read used by the float switch so the application can treat the switch as a small reusable sensor object.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Date</title>

<para>Created on Jun 9, 2026 </para>
</formalpara>
<formalpara><title>Author</title>

<para>malaika </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
